Hello,

I would like to announce my candidacy for the PTL of the OpenStack Charms
project for the 2027.1 cycle.

I've been a core team member of the OpenStack Charms project since 2019, and
a contributor since 2015. Throughout my tenure, I have contributed across the
majority of our charms, focusing on delivering new features, developing new
charms, addressing bug fixes, and managing stable backports.

During the 2026.2 cycle I led the effort to add Ubuntu 24.04 (Noble) support
across our charm collection, contributed to our CI tooling with charmbuild
integration, and updated the charm-guide documentation for Noble.

I look forward to the possibility of leading the team through the upcoming
cycle and continuing to support the growth of the OpenStack Charms ecosystem.

Cheers,
--
Felipe Reyes.
